The EMA-smoothed SLV violates non-decreasing at Gen~2, placing $r{=}0.2$ below $r_{\text{crit}}$, yet the smoothed signal ($\max \Delta_t = 0.0016$, below $\tau{=}0.002$) fails to trigger the controller.
